    "Reversed rays, projected to their terminal vertex", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"b792bc96-1cea-45d0-b33d-44636a80a5f5"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "b3bcc8b6-3c5b-447b-8a95-159110a11a4b"], Cell[
    "InfraDisplacementBundle[g,r]", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "b428ba3b-f04b-42d1-8e2c-277977fbdf52"], Cell["\<\
Pairs of vertices at distance r, projected to the first vertex\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"1fe8e650-57af-4c42-b905-8c9b381d801f"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "ed025716-9e86-4003-b0aa-210c01ca1d8f"], Cell[
    "InfraBundleMorphism", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
