Cell["\<\
Metric-selected Levi-Civita constructions can retain partial matchings. A \
partial result need not satisfy the complete-connection predicate of the \
general framework. The model-specific transport overload omits blocked \
starting points; this differs from transport by a complete connection, which \
is a total fiber bijection.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fac37089-71bd-4768-ae22-18089e54d1ea"],

Cell["\<\
The legacy random generator remains available with its earlier vertical-count \
options and cyclic-width horizontal rule. It is a compatibility model, not \
the property-constrained generator used in the foundation tutorial.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ccee7e6f-f3ee-4d30-9d40-d925d886e282"],

